DESCRIPTION

  A BOOPSI class which creates a gadget with a scalable image.  Suits well
  for an iconifygadget in a window's top border.

  The source is just grabbed from a program of mine and may contain custom
  functions.  It should however be easy enough to figure out how this
  class works and make the small adjustments necessary before including
  it in your own code.

REQUIREMENTS

  OS 2.04 or higher.

AVAILABILITY

  ftp://ftp.wustl.edu/pub/aminet/dev/c/IconifyButtonclass.lha (1.680)

PRICE

  Free.

DISTRIBUTABILITY

  Freeware.
